Let  $N$  be the midpoint of side  $BC$ ,  $G$  and  $H$  be the points where the incircle touches sides  $AC$  and  $AB$ , respectively, and  $I$  and  $J$  be the incenters of triangles  $ABC$  and  $DXY$ , respectively.
[asy]
import geometry;
